# "Exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less" (CR 115.1, 202.3): Bot2 controls Smaug the
# Magnificent (mana value 4, one past the boundary), a Mountain (a land), and Brazen Borrower (mana value exactly 3);
# Bot1's own Mox Jet is also on the battlefield. Only the Borrower is a candidate: the others are refused beside it. It
# is exiled until Solitary Cell leaves the battlefield (CR 610.3).
# Then "{1}, {T}, Discard a legendary card: Draw a card.": the Mountain in Bot1's hand is not a legal discard
# (refused beside Smaug the Magnificent, the legendary control), the Smaug is, and Bot1 draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Solitary Cell
Smaug the Magnificent
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Smaug the Magnificent
Island
Mox Sapphire
Brazen Borrower
Island x10

